1
00:00:00,095 --> 00:00:02,765
(Sheldon:)We happen to live in
a golden age of television.

2
00:00:04,066 --> 00:00:06,406
-Excuse me, fellas.

3
00:00:06,569 --> 00:00:08,309
Sorry for eavesdropping,
but there actually was

4
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:11,540
some big string theory news today
out of the Hadron Collider.

5
00:00:11,707 --> 00:00:13,987
(Sheldon:)Really?
Did they find evidence to support

6
00:00:14,143 --> 00:00:15,923
(Sheldon:)extra dimensions
or supersymmetry?

7
00:00:16,078 --> 00:00:19,928
(Barry:)No, but they did find evidence
that you'll believe anything.

8
00:00:21,817 --> 00:00:23,157
(Sheldon:)Why would you do that?

9
00:00:23,319 --> 00:00:25,299
(Sheldon:)You're a string theorist as well.

10
00:00:25,454 --> 00:00:28,234
Incorrect.
I am a string pragmatist.

11
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:30,730
I say I'm gonna prove something
that cannot be proved,

12
00:00:30,893 --> 00:00:32,163
I apply for grant money,

13
00:00:32,328 --> 00:00:34,568
(Barry:)and then I spend it
on liquor and broads.

14
00:00:35,664 --> 00:00:37,574
(Howard:)Later.

15
00:00:39,501 --> 00:00:41,741
(Sheldon:)Do you think he's right?

16
00:00:41,837 --> 00:00:46,017
(Sheldon:)Am I wasting my life on a theory
that can never be proven?

17
00:00:48,844 --> 00:00:53,034
(Howard:)Maybe. But how great
is Game of Thrones?

